edits_description = "The background and the biwa monster were edited out."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_o646o")
blurb = "Depicts a pair of yōkai, the Koto Furunushi (\"old master koto\") and the Biwa Bokuboku, both considered harmless.

The Koto Furunushi looks like a koto (a Japanese zither) which grows a demonic face on its front.

The Biwa Bokuboku is an anthropomorphic being with the head of a biwa (a Japanese lute). It comes to life at night and sits calmly in a tatami room, singing and plinking while lamenting the neglect of its former owner. Other stories report it dancing through inhabited houses while making much noise."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
